---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About FullTVBox" description="Who we are and how we test TV boxes.">
  <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-8">About FullTVBox</h1>

    <div class="prose prose-invert prose-lg max-w-none
      prose-headings:font-bold prose-headings:text-white
      prose-p:text-gray-300 prose-a:text-brand prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline">

      <p>
        FullTVBox is an independent review site dedicated to helping you find the right streaming
        device. We test Android TV boxes, streaming sticks, and media players — and we tell you
        what we actually think, without manufacturer influence.
      </p>

      <h2>Our Approach</h2>
      <p>
        We buy or borrow every device we review. No freebies accepted from manufacturers, no paid
        placements, no sponsored rankings. Our only revenue comes from affiliate commissions — if
        you click a product link and buy, we earn a small percentage at no extra cost to you.
      </p>

      <h2>What We Test</h2>
      <p>
        Every device goes through at least two weeks of daily use. We test boot speed, app launch
        times, 4K HDR and Dolby Vision playback, audio passthrough (Dolby Atmos, DTS:X), Wi-Fi
        reliability, remote usability, and how the device holds up after software updates.
      </p>

      <h2>Who We Are</h2>
      <p>
        A small team of home theater enthusiasts who got tired of review sites that just reprint
        spec sheets. We write the reviews we wished existed before buying our own devices.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Found an error or have a device you'd like us to review? Reach us at{' '}
        <a href="mailto:hello@fulltvbox.com">hello@fulltvbox.com</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
